WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:02.440
Come with me to reinforce the east gate

00:02.520 --> 00:04.080
The Wuzhao have been besieging three sides, leaving one open

00:04.160 --> 00:04.640
Now

00:04.720 --> 00:05.960
North and west are under attack

00:06.040 --> 00:07.320
But the east is quiet

00:07.400 --> 00:07.960
They're likely waiting

00:08.040 --> 00:09.440
For us to move the east garrison

00:09.520 --> 00:10.920
To reinforce elsewhere

00:11.360 --> 00:12.760
Then attack the east

00:12.840 --> 00:13.640
Let's go

00:13.720 --> 00:14.480
We're going to the east

00:14.600 --> 00:15.640
Yes

